# City Culture 1: the reference SHA-256 of the stacked VFS image and its bad
# sector map, recorded once the image passed the bit-perfect test
# (docs/emulator-pack-plan.md, phase 6). Every later vfs stage must match.
#
# Recorded 2026-11-04 from vfs-41ab10c: DS2S2 DS1S2 DS2S1 DS1S1 at decode-orc
# 5323ee1, ld-decode 1e8f04a. 270657536 bytes, 132157 EFM sectors; 107902
# listed bad, all before the filesystem (140) or in free space (107762). The
# data jumps from 00:05:11 to 24:01:72; since decode-orc#359 every set fills
# the gap, so the images line up with offset == address.
